<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $63-1/2 ON WALL STREET.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $63-1/2 ON WALL STREET.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened up $0-1/4 at $63-1/2 in New York on Tuesday, and it rose further to $63-5/8.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponds to about 301.97 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
